# Example environment file. Copy to .env and provide real values.
# .env is git-ignored; this file is committed to document the variables konfig reads.
#
# konfig is a library: none of these are required for development. They are the
# runtime environment variables the library itself understands, documented here
# for local experimentation with the samples.
#
# Active config format override (yaml / json / sqlite):
# KONFIG_CONFIG_FORMAT=
#
# Designated AWS Secrets Manager secret holding all secrets as a JSON bundle:
# KONFIG_AWS_SECRETS_MANAGER=
#
# AWS Secrets Manager secret holding the full settings tree as JSON:
# KONFIG_AWS_SETTINGS=
